# 19. Import validation

Perform validation after parsing.

Potential findings include:

### Errors

* duplicate person ID;
* duplicate place ID;
* duplicate family definition;
* malformed CSV section;
* missing required record ID.

### Warnings

* unknown parent ID;
* unknown child ID;
* unknown place ID;
* family-child relation pointing to missing family;
* self-parent relation;
* ancestor cycle;
* malformed coordinate;
* malformed date;
* death before birth;
* child apparently born before parent;
* highly implausible parental age.

### Information

* unresolved place coordinate;
* incomplete date;
* unknown parent;
* unsupported extra CSV section.

The application must distinguish:

```text
Error
Warning
Information
```

Warnings should normally allow import to continue.

