# 36. SVG export

SVG should be the preferred export format for genealogy charts where technically practical.

SVG output should preserve:

* vector text;
* vector lines;
* vector shapes.

It should not simply contain a raster screenshot of the browser.

---

# 37. PDF export

PDF generation must be appropriate for printing and publication.

Where possible:

```text
tree/fan chart SVG
        ↓
vector PDF
```

rather than:

```text
browser screenshot
        ↓
JPEG/PNG
        ↓
PDF
```

The latter should not be used for vector genealogy visualizations.

---

