# 53. Vite and GitHub Pages

The production build must account for GitHub Pages potentially serving the application below a repository path:

```text
https://username.github.io/repository-name/
```

Configure the Vite base path accordingly.

The application must work correctly when hosted from a non-root path.

Static assets must not assume:

```text
/
```

is the deployment root.

